// OpenUI component library for the Fabulist narrator pane (W2.4).
//
// Contract (verified against @openuidev/svelte-lang@0.3.2, see the W0.4 spike):
//   ScenePane(title, children) · MeterBar(label, value, max)
//   ObjectCard(name, kind, description) · BeatCard(text)
//
// The Wave 2a design review culled the flavor set to ten (Visual Toolkit); each
// is a leaf renderer with its own prop schema, mirrored as plain JSON in
// ./schemas/flavors.json (generated by scripts/gen_flavors_json.mjs) for the
// narrator-side validation gate.
//
// Registration is pure code. The zod key order IS the OpenUI Lang positional
// argument order, and the statement named `root` is the render entry point.
// `defineComponent(...).ref` lets parents declare which children are legal,
// which also drives `library.prompt()` and per-prop validation errors.

